GODMODE 0.20.0

  GODMODE gives your agents the goddamn keys.

  Your profile and keys are stored in local files. Agents use these
  keys as you. They can spend money, change live systems and delete data.

Install

  curl -fsSL https://get.godmode.build | bash

Commands

  godmode               active setup, providers and agents
  godmode intro         replay the warning and power-up
  godmode active        show selected business and keys
  godmode use ENV        switch the saved key environment
  godmode faq           keys, files and source

Source

  https://github.com/lofimichael/godmode-cli

  Bubble Tea and Lip Gloss drive the Go interface. The Python file engine
  is embedded in it. The separate source archive includes Go, Python
  and pinned vendored dependencies.
  godmode source prints the engine. godmode build-info lists dependencies.

